{"unit_id":"zclDragon__dsh-tool-generate-image#card-zh","repo":"zclDragon/dsh-tool-generate-image","commit":"0d75d26888fc4272ee3d294cd4ac3549a896b86e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-generate-image 是面向 DSH Web profile 的图片生成工具，将 generate_image 注册给模型。模型提交自然语言提示后，插件通过本机 Antigravity CLI（agy）调用 Gemini 生成图片，递归收集新生成的图片文件并复制到配置的输出目录，同时返回持久化文件路径。Web server 可用时，它还会注册仅接受回环连接的图片路由，将图片以内联 Markdown 引用形式返回。适合需要在 DSH 对话中按需创作插图、示意图或横幅的用户；使用前需安装并登录 agy。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:175-225","lib/index.js:254-329"]}
{"unit_id":"zclDragon__dsh-tool-generate-image#card-en","repo":"zclDragon/dsh-tool-generate-image","commit":"0d75d26888fc4272ee3d294cd4ac3549a896b86e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tool-generate-image adds an image generation tool to DSH Web. It calls Gemini through the local Antigravity CLI (agy), saves generated images to disk, and returns their paths. When a web server is available, it also provides an inline image reference. Install and sign in to agy before use.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:175-225","lib/index.js:254-329"]}
